Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:54.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}証明しよう　僕ら
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:57.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}本当はどうしたい？
