Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:04.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}しゃがむ心臓を叩いてった　Swing by
