Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:21.08,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}喉が渇いたって後悔はないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:26.80,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}擦りむいて埋めるの99%　小指には衝動を
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:32.01,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}本当はどうしたいんだっけ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}合図して　ハートチューンに乗せて
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:38.27,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}【Ah,ah Darlin' I know who you are. Ah,Ah】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:40.35,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}一番乗りで　Fly me to the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:43.69,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}【Ah,ah Darlin' I know who you are. Ah,Ah】
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:39.08,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}只是在远望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.75,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}伸出手时才回忆起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:44.21,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}不想被听见的软弱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:45.88,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}想传达给你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:49.05,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}不可能也是种可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.68,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}我一直都知道你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:54.43,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}让我们来证明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:57.22,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}内心究竟想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:59.48,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}想要逃避捂住双耳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:04.36,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}用力拍打蜷缩的心脏 Swing by
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:10.28,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}对着那毫无变化的表情 狠狠刺入答案
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:14.37,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}将情热瞄准月亮开火吧 狙击手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:17.24,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}未来似乎由你决定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:21.08,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}口渴难耐也绝不后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:26.80,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}带着擦伤填满那99% 小拇指勾起冲动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:32.01,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}真正想做的是什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.22,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}发出信号吧 搭上心跳的旋律
